Putting all of the above together we get that 
$
  Sigma (S : "FinSet"), X(S) ~= Sigma (n:NN, S: B S_n), X(S) ~= Sigma (n:NN), X([n]) slash.double S_n.
$

In words: The total space of a species splits into components by cardinality and the n-th component is precisely the action type $X([n]) slash.double S_n$.
